==Description==
'''Goofy Sledger''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It was obtained from rank 5 of the premium track, which costs {{Bell|120}} or {{Robux|140}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|370}} or {{Robux|280}}.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the second version of the default [[Sledger]] tower, pulling a silly face, with it is being hit with its own hammer on its head. It plays a bonk sound effect when used.

==Trivia==
*This sticker is likely a reference to the [[Sledger]] bonk meme.

